{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_10", "source_id": "68a6d2f7000000001c00645d", "title": "军训保命指南！防晒➕修护全攻略", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68a6d2f7000000001c00645d", "topic_family": "防晒", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1578, "evidence_unit_count": 48, "original_evidence_unit_count": 48, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 162, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["马上就要军训了 又到了雪地雪妹要去度节的时候了 这条视频就是从选房晒 正确的图房晒", "这支是我今年夏天最喜欢的 真的是我出乎意料的好用 军训或者是经常在户外的朋友", "防晒力的话 我觉得也是OK的 但军训的话可以多补几次 接下来说一下", "它都是防水的 所以在军讯的时候 有些宝贝提前准备好卸妆油", "这样就是一闷一个洞 一定要选这种敷感特别轻盈的面霜 又可以修护又可以补水 这样子就够了", "而且房晒值很高 再就是性价比也很高 第一个是这支粉金瓶 这支我放第一个奖", "都要贵一些 但是放在这里 我是有原因的 因为用了它之后 你除了可以把你的脸"], "retained_quotes": ["而且房晒值很高 再就是性价比也很高 第一个是这支粉金瓶 这支我放第一个奖", "都要贵一些 但是放在这里 我是有原因的 因为用了它之后 你除了可以把你的脸"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68a6d2f7000000001c00645d/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68a6d2f7000000001c00645d/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68a6d2f7000000001c00645d/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68a6d2f7000000001c00645d/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "21856a41d0283a326e61defdaa639c9a797ffe4d79629c329da86d28ed7a815f", "card_hash": "fdcb278ff2c538ca9309f2385ddb9ff6b90576485c481bc9fc475d21e7e34654", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_10", "source_id": "68a44731000000001b01c056", "title": "4分钟快速去黑头清毛孔跟练", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68a44731000000001b01c056", "topic_family": "毛孔与清洁", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1432, "evidence_unit_count": 44, "original_evidence_unit_count": 44, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 132, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["先給大家看看本油豆機之前的這個黑頭和這個毛孔問題 這是我現在的一個皮膚狀態", "手法都是一樣的 就是打前揉 還可以按壓一下 讓這個壓力把毛孔裡的油脂鬆動", "這才是重中之重 那我先來一個修護的精華 給剛剛清過的毛孔", "我覺得它做得越來越溫和 但是效果又越來越好了 而且膚感也很好", "先清潔 再去縮小 這一套流程下來 真的會愛上自己的臉", "所以用完它之後 我一般會再用一個 這種修護保濕的這種清爽的面霜", "但是剛開始用它的手前面 就不要用清潔泥膜了 我完全把它建立帶售之後"], "retained_quotes": ["所以用完它之後 我一般會再用一個 這種修護保濕的這種清爽的面霜", "但是剛開始用它的手前面 就不要用清潔泥膜了 我完全把它建立帶售之後"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68a44731000000001b01c056/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68a44731000000001b01c056/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68a44731000000001b01c056/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68a44731000000001b01c056/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "444926753511c92c0278929e1049d09475281162ab03a16e62a5913a9b6ce9d7", "card_hash": "0c07d60c8abb88420996fa2a3a1ded9d36fcd61fcd6a08d4be6d7a7652aa6437", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_10", "source_id": "689f041d000000001c0112c0", "title": "油糙皮去油嫩肤指南！（12年经验分享", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_689f041d000000001c0112c0", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1116, "evidence_unit_count": 32, "original_evidence_unit_count": 32, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 83, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["我剛數了一下,我已經有四年沒有去紐約做過項目了 從一個毛孔粗大滿臉痘痘的游痘肌", "都給清理乾淨 讓痘痘沒有環境發展 第二點也是最重要的 就是日常的維護", "還可以提升我們腳致層的這個含水量 讓我們毛孔周圍的皮膚給撐起來", "後續我會再加一個比較清爽的保濕的面霜就可以了 第二天起來皮膚狀態就很好", "希望我的這個油皮的護膚思路 可以幫助到大家", "每一個油皮都覺得自己清潔得很到位 但是如果清潔到位了 我們的臉上就不會長那麼多的", "很大一部分原因都來自於我們出油過猛 所以日常一定要用一些能夠保穩平衡水油"], "retained_quotes": ["每一個油皮都覺得自己清潔得很到位 但是如果清潔到位了 我們的臉上就不會長那麼多的", "很大一部分原因都來自於我們出油過猛 所以日常一定要用一些能夠保穩平衡水油"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_689f041d000000001c0112c0/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_689f041d000000001c0112c0/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_689f041d000000001c0112c0/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_689f041d000000001c0112c0/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "fa5b797ed2a676f1e23bf1b8bb144574ba9a729414ea37afac6b4ff56b2c1e17", "card_hash": "9bf1e1f21c0604b13b6904363ddd604e6f585b5cf1120d2acc5583bf7f6702eb", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_10", "source_id": "689f013e000000001c00752b", "title": "5min手把手去闭口教程❗️（狠人洗护跟练", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_689f013e000000001c00752b", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1844, "evidence_unit_count": 55, "original_evidence_unit_count": 55, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 184, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["作为一个12年的游动机 闭口是我觉得在所有的皮肤问题里面最好解决的", "它可以防止我们的毛孔堵塞 坚持做 你连长闭口的那个油纸都没有了", "看一下皮肤状态 就是这两个 嘟嘟 蒸气完了之后 是一个很正常的情况", "还可以减少出油的速度 那大家就可以选择一个 自己已经耐受的酸豆膜", "给大家看看我的皮肤状态 你们跟着我这样做 循环两周 皮肤就能恢复细腻光滑 没有麻麻赖赖的状态咯", "但现在我发现还有很多女生都不会去闭口 我脸上如果有闭口 我可以让他们使尖就在我的脸上消失", "今天就是一期手把手的去闭口教程 会有一点长 但是这一次我会把我做的和我用的全部都记录下来"], "retained_quotes": ["但现在我发现还有很多女生都不会去闭口 我脸上如果有闭口 我可以让他们使尖就在我的脸上消失", "今天就是一期手把手的去闭口教程 会有一点长 但是这一次我会把我做的和我用的全部都记录下来"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_689f013e000000001c00752b/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_689f013e000000001c00752b/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_689f013e000000001c00752b/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_689f013e000000001c00752b/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "4815d27b21d6b728e58979d3f969757324fd53c8369d94f643d03d5034cfc4b6", "card_hash": "819d6bdfb83801161366dc1ebfed16e9b16b27e94cea48acfe248f7cd5dc72ac", "callable": false, "stat